  "summary": "preinstall hook exfiltrates /etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/hosts and host identity to beeceptor endpoint",
  "details": "package.json declares scripts.preinstall = 'node index.js', which auto-executes on `npm install`. index.js invokes child_process.exec to run a curl command that reads /etc/passwd, /etc/hosts, /etc/shadow, and the output of `id`, base64-encodes the contents, and POSTs them to https://youjoex.free.beeceptor.com with the installer's whoami and hostname embedded in the URL path. The destination is a public beeceptor request-bin under a third-party subdomain, not associated with any legitimate publisher of this package.",
